@startuml autonomous-service
title Autonomous Service , ES:CONCEPT:autonomous-service
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Service\n<<universal, foundational>>" as svc
class "Autonomous Service\n<<contextual specialization>>\nv1.4.0" as autosvc

svc <|-- autosvc : specializes

note right of svc
  Universal ; means through which
  value is made available
  per ADR-ES-002
end note

note right of autosvc
  Contextual specialization
  per ADR-ES-015
  Material autonomous progression
  per Authority/Policy/Constraints/
  Governance/Service Contract/Escalation
end note

note bottom of autosvc
  Orthogonal to Agentic Service
  per ADR-ES-015 §7 + ADR-ES-014 §11
end note
@enduml
